@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - Inactivate Figure Category

actor "Show Designer" as USER
participant ":System" as System

autonumber

USER -> System : Inactivate Figure Category
activate System

System --> USER : Show Active Categories
deactivate System

USER -> System : Select Category
activate System

System --> USER : Display Category Info or error
deactivate System

@enduml
